            "text": "STS Electronic Recycling adheres to NIST SP 800-88 Rev. 2 guidelines for physical and cryptographic media sanitization, DoD 5220.22-M wiping parameters, and California universal waste management standards. We provide complete audit support for Bakersfield organizations operating under HIPAA, GLBA, and SOX regulatory frameworks."
