            "text": "Our logistics fleet provides scheduled commercial electronics recycling pickups across Bakersfield, Oildale, Delano, Shafter, Wasco, Arvin, and Tehachapi. We coordinate regular service routes along Highway 99, Highway 58, and the Interstate 5 industrial corridor."
