        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is commercial electronics pickup really free in Bakersfield?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, STS offers complimentary pickup services for qualifying commercial volumes of computers, laptops, enterprise servers, and networking hardware throughout Bakersfield. Our coordinators verify inventory volume and logistics requirements prior to scheduling on-site collection."
