        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How quickly can electronics recycling pickups be scheduled in Bakersfield?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Commercial technology pickups across Bakersfield and Kern County are typically scheduled within the same week. Our logistics specialists coordinate directly with facility managers to accommodate loading docks, staging protocols, and corporate operating hours."
