            "text": "Yes. The 200,000 sq ft processing operation handles campus refreshes, clinic rollouts, and data center decommissioning for Bakersfield and Kern County organizations. Seasonal electronic asset disposal for growers such as Grimmway Farms is scheduled around harvest windows. Multi-building coordination covers energy yards, packing plants, and public-sector warehouses in a single documented chain of custody. Serial tracking and Certificates of Destruction remain part of every large engagement."
          }
        },
        {
