            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Bakersfield organizations can recycle desktops, laptops, servers, networking gear, printers, copiers, monitors, phones, and legacy electronics with STS. Data-bearing devices receive NIST 800-88 sanitization, and qualifying volumes include complimentary pickup across Kern County. Computer recycling, laptop recycling, cell phone recycling, and server equipment recycling are included alongside ink, toner, and old electronics. Healthcare, energy, and agriculture sites typically mix office PCs with field laptops and warehouse scanners on one documented route."
